	(footprint "lib:LGA-48_7x7mm_P0.5mm_EP_ESP32-PICO_L"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "cb66f9c9-9bcc-48a8-af09-c81f71adb6cf")
		(at 110.350001 122.75 -90)
		(descr "Espressif ESP32-PICO-V3 / -V3-02 SiP, LGA-48 7 x 7 mm, P0.50, EP 4.50 C0.5 = GND (49). Land exactly per ESP32-PICO Series Datasheet v1.3 Fig 16 p59 (pads 0.68 x 0.25 R0.05 at +-3.365, copper-defined, mask +0.05 = 0.78 x 0.35; EP solder-mask-defined, mask margin 0); EP paste 16 x 0.75 per Fig 17 p60 (44.7 %); pad paste 1:1 (Fig 17 toe overprint not used, equal volume at a 0.10 mm stencil). Body Fig 14 p56 (7.00, A 0.94). EP vias on the board (DS: 21 x 0.25 on 1.05 / 2.00 grid; here 0.35/0.20 filled+capped via-in-pad, P5). 3D: KiCad stock QFN-48-1EP_7x7mm_P0.5mm_EP5.6x5.6mm (CC-BY-SA 4.0), z scaled to 0.94 mm. Spec hardware/tools/land_specs/LGA-48_7x7mm_P0.5mm_EP_ESP32-PICO.json | IPC-7351 least density (L) variant per D109: toe 3.575 (D 6.90/7.00/7.10, L1 0/0.075/0.15 -> terminal end 3.55 max + 0.025), heel 3.025 and width 0.25 kept, EP 4.50 C0.5/paste/mask unchanged")
		(tags "ESP32-PICO-V3 ESP32 SiP LGA-48 7x7 0.5mm ELRS in-package flash IPC7351L")
		(property "Reference" "U16"
