	(gr_text "ROUTING CHEAT SHEET  -  8L HDI 1+6+1  -  NextPCB  -  keys from user.hotkeys (Cmd+V = paste)\nLAYERS   L1 parts | L2 GND | L3 sig | L4 PWR | L5 PWR | L6 sig | L7 GND | L8 parts\n\nVIA          SIZE                     SPAN         KEY (Mac)\nmicro        0.25/0.10                L1-L2 L8-L7  Opt+V, pick L2/L7\nburied       0.33/0.15  (all classes) L2-L7        Opt+V, pick L3-L6\nthrough      none - DRC error\nthen         close KiCad, say \"via pass\" (makes the stacks)\nlabel check  1-2 / 7-8 micro | 2-7 buried | 1-8 through\n\nESCAPE (stacked allowed, order = HDI Rank 2)\nGND pin      pad > Opt+V > L2                 done\nsignal       pad > Opt+V > pick L3/L6 > L3/L6\npower        stacked micro+buried array > L4/L5\nfine pitch   micro in pad (filled + capped)\noptional     stagger buried 0.25 c-c (lands overlap)\n\nNEVER\nmicro on micro   micro L1-L3   via on RF net   tracks on L2/L7   2 oz copper\n\nWIDTHS\nmin track 0.089 (3.5 mil)   RF 50R 0.105 gap 0.15   USB 90R 0.12/0.12\n\nCHECK\nE on via = type + layers   DRC per block   B = refill zones\n\"holes co-located\" warning on a stack = expected"
